  "summary": "mindwalk is a visualization tool that replays coding-agent sessions as light moving through a night-style map of the codebase, showing where the agent searched, read, and edited. The CLI offers serve, open, map, build, trace, and analyze subcommands, with flags such as --port, --no-open, per-agent session dirs, --judge, --model, and --no-rubric.",
